摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"A tiny glass companion for DeepSeek Harness — it breathes while the agent thinks, pulses while it works, and politely checks with you before touching anything. 🍎 Liquid Glass looks · 🌱 zero extra dependencies · 👀 always knows what your agent is up to；给 DeepSeek Harness 的一只小玻璃伙伴——","id":"gh:1334108212","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-dynamic-island","slug":"YLifeOnlyOnce/dsh-dynamic-island","topics":["dsh","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugins","harness"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"A tiny glass companion for DeepSeek Harness — it breathes while the agent thinks, pulses while it wo"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"rks, and politely checks with you before touching anything. 🍎 Liquid Glass looks · 🌱 zero extra depe"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"ndencies · 👀 always knows what your agent is up to；给 DeepSeek Harness 的一只小玻璃伙伴——"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# 🛰️ DSH Dynamic Island"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**A tiny glass companion for DeepSeek Harness — it breathes while the agent thinks, pulses while it "},{"id":"p3s2","text":"works, and politely checks with you before touching anything.**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"🍎 Liquid Glass looks · 🌱 zero extra dependencies · 👀 always knows what your agent is up to"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"中文 · MIT"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"> **Status: a high-fidelity design prototype** — the place where a Dynamic Island for DeepSeek Harne"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"ss gets designed, iterated, and proven before it becomes a real plugin. ⭐ Star it to keep the island"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"signed, iterated, and proven before it becomes a real plugin. ⭐ Star it to keep the island in orbit."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## 🪟 The island, in the wild"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"| Chilling over the workspace | Opens when it needs you | Leaves a tiny receipt |"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"The island lives quietly in the corner of your workspace. The moment your agent starts doing somethi"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"ng worth knowing about — thinking, running a tool, waiting for your approval, or hitting a snag — it"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"about — thinking, running a tool, waiting for your approval, or hitting a snag — it springs to life."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## 🧭 What is this?"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"`dsh-dynamic-island` is a high-fidelity, Apple **Liquid Glass**–inspired Dynamic Island concept for "},{"id":"p11s2","text":"DeepSeek Harness. It turns the agent's inner life — thinking, tool calls, approvals, failures, compl"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"etion — into a lightweight, readable, *slightly companion-like* surface that sits on the edge of you"},{"id":"p11s4","text":"nto a lightweight, readable, *slightly companion-like* surface that sits on the edge of your screen."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"This is **not** an unrelated desktop pet. Every shape change comes from real Harness state: you alwa"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"ys know whether the agent is working, what it's doing, whether it needs your call, and how the task "},{"id":"p12s3","text":"w whether the agent is working, what it's doing, whether it needs your call, and how the task ended."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## ✨ Why you'll like it"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"- 🍬 **Genuine Liquid Glass** — layered transparency, springy shapes, and light that actually moves. "},{"id":"p14s2","text":"All hand-rolled CSS, no UI library.\n- 🎯 **Status first, always** — the companion's face, core light,"},{"id":"p14s3","text":" edge color, and words all tell the same story. No fake animations pretending to be \"AI thinking\".\n-"},{"id":"p14s4","text":" 🤫 **Low-disturbance by design** — it stays a quiet dot until something matters. When a task complet"},{"id":"p14s5","text":"es it leaves a short receipt, then settles back down.\n- 🛡️ **Respectful of your call** — approvals m"},{"id":"p14s6","text":"irror the harness's native input area: the island is a second, synchronized place to act, never a ro"},{"id":"p14s7","text":"gue state machine.\n- ♿ **Accessible & polite** — respects `prefers-reduced-motion`, never relies on "},{"id":"p14s8","text":"color alone, and keeps approval actions as real buttons.\n- 🌱 **Zero runtime dependencies** — React a"},{"id":"p14s9","text":"nd a sprinkle of CSS. Nothing else."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## 🎨 The five moods"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"| Mood | The vibe | Tone |"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"| 🛰️ Idle | `agent/status: idle` — a quiet dot that says \"ready when you are\" | slate |\n| 🧠 Thinking"},{"id":"p17s2","text":" | Breathing core; capsule shows the current task & step | aqua |\n| 🛠️ Working | Teal pulse while a "},{"id":"p17s3","text":"tool runs — name and progress on screen | mint |\n| 🫵 Approval | Warm coral edge — expands with real "},{"id":"p17s4","text":"批准 / 暂不 buttons | coral |\n| ✅ Complete | A soft refractive highlight + a result receipt + a stack of"},{"id":"p17s5","text":" recent wins | lime |\n| ⚠️ Alert | Orange pause — failure summary and a way back in | amber |\n| 🔒 Bl"},{"id":"p17s6","text":"ocked | `turn/end {blocked}` — the goal paused, waiting for you to unblock | violet |\n| ✂️ Max-token"},{"id":"p17s7","text":"s | `turn/end {max-tokens}` — output truncated, ask it to continue | rose |"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## 🔌 How it talks to DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"The concept maps each Harness signal to one island mood — a narrow, versionable client protocol inst"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"ead of drowning in the raw event stream:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"| Island mood | DSH signal |"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"| `idle` | `agent/status: idle` |\n| `thinking` | `agent/status: running`, `step/start`, `assistant/c"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"hunk` (reasoning-delta) |\n| `working` | `tool/call` → the matching `tool/result` (incl. `error` / `m"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"eta`) |\n| `approval` | a pending approval in the composer |\n| `complete` | a successful `turn/end` +"},{"id":"p21s4","text":" `assistant/message.usage` |\n| `alert` | `tool/result` error, `agent/request-error`, `turn/end {erro"},{"id":"p21s5","text":"r}` |\n| `blocked` | `turn/end {blocked}` |\n| `max-tokens` | `turn/end {max-tokens}` |"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"On top of the eight moods, each state also carries **payload fields** (stream, tool cards, receipt, "},{"id":"p22s2","text":" moods, each state also carries **payload fields** (stream, tool cards, receipt, goal, todos, jobs):"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"| Island element | DSH signal |"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"| Streaming preview (reasoning vs. answer tinted) | `assistant/chunk` (`text-delta` / `reasoning-del"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"ta`) |\n| Tool-command cards (exit code / duration / copy) | `tool/call.arguments` + `tool/result` |\n"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"| Result receipt (files / checks / tokens / duration) | `turn/end.reason` + `assistant/message.usage"},{"id":"p24s4","text":"` |\n| Goal progress ring | goal package: `roundsStarted` / round cap |\n| Todo ticker + three-state c"},{"id":"p24s5","text":"hecklist | `todo/write` (whole-list snapshot, last-write-wins) |\n| Background job chips | jobs packa"},{"id":"p24s6","text":"ge: `running \\| stopping \\| completed \\| killed \\| failed` + `detail` |\n| Recent-wins receipt stack "},{"id":"p24s7","text":"| `turn/end` sequence |\n| Model badge | `request/context` (provider · model) |\n| Stop / retry / unbl"},{"id":"p24s8","text":"ock / continue | `agent/turn-stopping` / `agent/request` / goal unblock / turn resume |\n| Subagent n"},{"id":"p24s9","text":"ote | `subagent/start` / `subagent/end` |"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"> Replay & persistence read `session/event`; live interaction reads `agent/*`. A production plugin s"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"till needs to pin down the client slot/connection injection points — and rules for no active session"},{"id":"p25s3","text":", a dropped stream, parallel sessions, and HMR reloads. That work is tracked on the roadmap.\n>\n> The"},{"id":"p25s4","text":" full \"what DSH needs × what the signal layer can do × how the island shows it\" analysis lives in do"},{"id":"p25s5","text":" needs × what the signal layer can do × how the island shows it\" analysis lives in docs/analysis.md."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## 🚀 Run it"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Open the address Vite prints — the `灵动岛演示` dock at the bottom flips between the eight moods:"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"- In **approval**, hit 批准 / 暂不 and watch the island reflect the result instantly;\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
